/*! \mainpage preC-SUMO Developer Guide

	ableofcontents

\section intro Introduction
preC-SUMO is the coupling-side translator between D-FlowFM and C-SUMO in a preCICE setup.

Current core responsibilities are:
- read and validate C-SUMO settings,
- register preCICE meshes and data channels,
- receive far-field data from preCICE and write FF2NF input files,
- wait for and read NF2FF output files,
- convert NF2FF results to connected source/sink writes for D-FlowFM.

\section workflow Core Workflow
The diagram below reflects the current code path in
pre_c_sumo::run(), receiveFFData(), writeFF2NFFiles(), waitForNF2FFFiles(),
readNF2FFFiles(), and convertNFtoConnectedSinkSources().

\dotfile preC_SUMO_Swimlanes.dot "preC-SUMO core coupling workflow (current implementation)"

\section code_map Code Entry Points
Main implementation entry points:
- pre_c_sumo::run in pre_c_sumo_lib.hpp / pre_c_sumo_lib.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::readCsumoSettingsFile in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::receiveFFData in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::writeFF2NFFiles in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::waitForNF2FFFiles in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::readNF2FFFiles in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp
- pre_c_sumo::convertNFtoConnectedSinkSources in coupling_steps.hpp / coupling_steps.cpp

\section notes Diagram Source Files
Diagrams are maintained in docs/include as .dot and .drawio source files.
Use \dotfile for .dot diagrams in Doxygen.
*/


